@namespace PlayBlazor.Demo.Daisy
@using DaisyBlazor.Data
@using DaisyBlazor.Layout
@using DaisyBlazor.Validation
@* Static example fragments used as slot presets, each mirrored verbatim by a string in
   DaisyDemoFragmentSources.cs. Any Tailwind class written here is compiled into app.css, since the
   CLI scans this project's .razor and .cs files; runtime-composed classes come from DaisyBlazor's
   safelist instead. Fragments land with the batches that curate their components.

   The In* members are scaffolds: they take the played specimen and place it inside the parent it
   needs, beside a sibling so the child shows as one of several (tab strips, timelines and steps
   draw their connectors and selection between siblings). *@
